<title>NEW ZEALAND: Enerco ups half yr profit to NZ$12.89 mln.</title>
<headline>Enerco ups half yr profit to NZ$12.89 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   12.89 vs 10.02</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 15.2 vs 11.8</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				 10.5 vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				   103.3 vs 90.3</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     20.2 vs 16.1</p>
<p>    Tax					   7.28 vs 6.11</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Dec 11</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 29</p>
<p>    Ex div   Dec 2</p>
<p>Note - Enerco New Zealand Ltd is a natural gas distributor.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
